<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  /* Basic styling to mimic document structure */
  body { font-family: "Liberation Serif", "DejaVu Serif", Georgia, serif; }
  h1, h2, h3 { font-weight: bold; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 10px; }
  td { padding: 4px 0; }
  .form-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .label-col { width: 40%; }
  .value-col { width: 60%; }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div>
      <h3 style="font-size: 12pt;">Form 4852</h3>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">(Revised September 1986)</p>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">OMB No. 1545-0458</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Expires 3-31-87</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2 style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">SUBSTITUTE FOR FORM W-2, WAGE AND TAX STATEMENT OR FORM W-2P, STATEMENT FOR RECIPIENTS OF ANNUITIES, PENSIONS, RETIRED PAY, OR IRA PAYMENTS</h2>
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <span data-field="attachment_note">{{ attachment_note }}</span>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <p style="font-weight: bold;">1. NAME (First, middle, last)</p>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 1.2em;">
        <span data-field="full_name">{{ full_name }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 48%; text-align: right;">
      <p style="font-weight: bold;">2. SOCIAL SECURITY NUMBER</p>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 1.2em;">
        <span data-field="ssn">{{ ssn }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">3. ADDRESS (Number, street city, State, ZIP code)</p>
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 1.2em;">
      <span data-field="address">{{ address }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">4. PLEASE FILL IN THE YEAR AT THE END OF THIS STATEMENT.</p>
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 1.2em;">
      <span data-field="tax_year">{{ tax_year }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 30px; font-size: 10pt;">
    <p>I have been unable to obtain or have received an incorrect Form W-2, Wage and Tax Statement, or Form W-2P, Statement for Recipients of Annuities, Pensions, Retired Pay, or IRA Payments, from my employer or payer named below, and have so notified the Internal Revenue Service. The amounts shown below are my best estimates of all wages or payments paid to me and the Federal taxes withheld by this employer or payer during <span data-field="tax_year_range">{{ tax_year_range }}</span>.</p>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <p style="font-weight: bold;">5. EMPLOYER'S OR PAYER'S NAME, ADDRESS, AND ZIP CODE</p>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 1.2em;">
        <span data-field="employer.name">{{ employer.name }}</span>
      </div>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 1.2em;">
        <span data-field="employer.address">{{ employer.address }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 48%; text-align: right;">
      <p style="font-weight: bold;">6. EMPLOYER'S OR PAYER'S IDENTIFICATION NUMBER (If known)</p>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 1.2em;">
        <span data-field="employer.tin">{{ employer.tin }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 20px;">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 25%; padding-bottom: 5px;">7. ADVANCE EIC (Earned Income Credit) PAYMENTS RECEIVED</td>
        <td style="width: 25%; padding-bottom: 5px;">8. FEDERAL INCOME TAX WITHHELD</td>
        <td style="width: 25%; padding-bottom: 5px;">9. WAGES, TIPS, OTHER COMPENSATION OR PAYMENTS (See Note Below)</td>
        <td style="width: 25%; padding-bottom: 5px;">10. SOCIAL SECURITY TAX WITHHELD</td>
        <td style="width: 25%; padding-bottom: 5px;">11. SOCIAL SECURITY WAGES</td>
        <td style="width: 25%; padding-bottom: 5px;">12. SOCIAL SECURITY TIPS</td>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 2em;">
          <span data-field="amount_7">{{ amount_7 }}</span>
        </td>
        <td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 2em;">
          <span data-field="amount_8">{{ amount_8 }}</span>
        </td>
        <td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 2em;">
          <span data-field="amount_9">{{ amount_9 }}</span>
        </td>
        <td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 2em;">
          <span data-field="amount_10">{{ amount_10 }}</span>
        </td>
        <td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 2em;">
          <span data-field="amount_11">{{ amount_11 }}</span>
        </td>
        <td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 2em;">
          <span data-field="amount_12">{{ amount_12 }}</span>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px; font-size: 10pt;">
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">NOTE:</p>
    <p>Include the total of (1) wages paid, (2) noncash payments, (3) tips/reported, and (4) all other compensation before deductions for taxes, insurance, etc.</p>
    <p>13. How did you determine the amounts in items 7 through 12 above?</p>
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 1.2em;">
      <span data-field="determination_method">{{ determination_method }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">14. Give reason Form W-2, W-2P (or W-2C, Statement of Corrected Income and Tax Amounts) was not furnished by employer, or payer, if known, and explain your efforts to get it.</p>
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 3em;">
      <span data-field="reason_for_non_furnishing">{{ reason_for_non_furnishing }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">Paperwork Reduction Notice</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">We ask for this information to carry out the Internal Revenue laws of the United States. We need it to ensure that taxpayers are complying with these laws and to allow us to figure and collect the right amount of tax. You are required to give us this information.</p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px; font-size: 10pt;">
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">IMPORTANT NOTICE:</p>
    <p>If your employer has ceased operations or filed for bankruptcy, you may wish to send a copy of this form to the Social Security Administration, 13-D-6 Metro West Tower, 301 N. Green Street, Baltimore, Maryland 21201. Attn: Lewis Oppenheimer, to ensure proper social security credit.</p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px; font-size: 10pt;">
    <p>Under penalties of perjury, I declare that I have examined this statement, and to the best of my knowledge and belief, it is true, correct, and complete.</p>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 50px;">
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <p style="font-weight: bold;">15. Your signature</p>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 1.2em;">
        <span data-field="signature">{{ signature }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 48%; text-align: right;">
      <p style="font-weight: bold;">16. Date</p>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; height: 1.2em;">
        <span data-field="date">{{ date }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px; font-size: 8pt; text-align: center;">
    U.S.P.GPO 1986-0-181-457/6461
    <br>
    Form 4852 (Rev. 9-86)
  </div>
</div>